The MIT licence above covers the tool's code: build.py, src/app.js, src/index.html
and the code in src/font.js. These parts of the repository and of index.html
have their own licences:

- Salon Pixel font data (the glyph table in src/font.js, and the same data in
  index.html): copyright 2026 imperial64, SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
  Full text: assets/salon-pixel/LICENSE-OFL.txt.

- The three lantern and chain pieces in assets/modern-mizunos/ (and embedded in
  index.html): from Modern Mizunos v0.5.2 by Kchem and Garden Gals,
  https://modrinth.com/organization/garden-gals, licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/). See
  assets/modern-mizunos/CREDIT.md. Pages exported with the ornaments on are
  adaptations of these pieces and carry the same licence and credit.

- The sample issue (sample/, and embedded in index.html): its copy, screenshots
  and skin are the Beeblecraft Gazette, No. 1, by imperial64, shared as an
  example. The published pages of that issue are CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
